A weary traveler upon the doorstep of Zeta squad? Color me surprised!
-> I'm Pseudo Mu
  A pseudo detective?
  What are you doing here? There was already a peace keeper here earlier. I'm busy, leave me be.
  <<set $filmontMet to 1>>
