<<if equipped() == 2>>
A weary traveler upon the doorstep of Zeta squad? Color me surprised!
-> I'm Pseudo Mu
  A pseudo detective?
  How rare, I have to admit I have a vague sense of interest in your kind. I've always wondered how you do your job, what makes you tick.
  You have to keep the mind busy, when doing dull work like mining. Zeta squad, no, manual labor in general must be so droll to you.
  Let me know if I can help with anything.
  -> About the accident
    Yes, that fools only accident was speaking out of turn.
    Speaking out of turn how? #PSEUDO MU
    What am I saying, sorry, I meant slipping, slipping out of turn. What happened to him was terrible, really, even if he was no help I hate to see him go like that.
    I should... I should get back to work, I don't think I'm feeling well...
    <<set $filmontMet to 1>>
  -> About Breacher
    Usually I'm not a fan of the hands of mission control, but you seem to be quite forthright. Breacher was surly and demanding.
    He took a map from Alfus, and I haven't seen him since, although thats to be expected...
    Expected? #PSEUDO MU
    No... No I should... I should get back to work- I don't think I'm feeling well...
    <<set $filmontMet to 1>>
-> I am a traveler
  Marvelous, I have to say i'm quite busy but I have an urge to hear of your travels. Please, speak to me again and introduce yourself.
  <<set $filmontMet to 1>>
<<endif>>
