<<if equipped() == 0 || equipped() == 1>>
This would surely come to pass no matter what happened. We all have a place to be in the world, and it seems this is ours. 
It was nice to meet you, albeit briefly, detective.
<<endif>>

<<if equipped() == 2>>
Fate has brought you here, to me. It's unfortunate under the circumstances, honestly I may have more a hand in this than I care to admit. Please, listen carefully.
This is not as it seems, you should escape while you can. Call for help, quickly.
<<endif>>

<<if equipped() == 4>>
Fate, fate is so fickle. That horrifying visage, this unholy stench, you've come for retribution havent you? Lawrence, that was a sin yet paid for.
Please, I have yet to accomplish so much, mercy! If you have it in your soul!
<<endif>>
