---
<<if equipped() == 0 || equipped() == 1>>
Ah, you're back again.
-> About Zeta Squad
  We've been here for months pulling up Cu prime. It pays the bills, but these deposits aren't even that impressive. At this pace, we won't finish before the year is up.
-> About Breacher
  Didn't we already go on about this? I can't say much. He came in and kicked us all out of the main mine shaft. Put up his tape and started investigating. I haven't seen the bloke since.
-> About Lawrence
  A good friend of mine. Well really he was recommended by Alfus... a hard worker he called him. That's all I know.
<<endif>>

<<if equipped() == 2>>
My well traveled friend has returned! You are positively glowing, what can I do for you?
-> About Zeta Squad
  It's dreadful, we'll never make enough to meet the quota. I'll be lucky to see sunlight in the next 6 months. Honestly it's breaking my spirit being trapped here for so long.
  They've been continuously denying our requests for an extended break.
  Everytime Alfus comes up with some scheme, I've ignored him, but lately I think I've begun to play along with him.
  What kind of scheme? #PSEUDO MU
  He said he found some Pt prime, but this isn't the first time. Everytime he sees a shiny speck, he starts the rumors.
  I'm sure you know all about it. This probably doesn't shock you at all, our desperate pipe dreams down here...
-> About Breacher
  Didn't we already go on about this? I can't stand him.
  You two must have taken seperate training, because he had no idea how to communicate. It was always his way or the highway.
  This whole thing seems silly to me, why we can't just do things the easy way? it's beyond me.
  So you know where he is? #PSEUDO MU
  Breacher? No I, well I mean, I saw him... You don't want to deal with him anyway, trust me. Such a bore. If I were you I'd just write him off as a loss.
-> About Lawrence
  A good guy... well really quite a philistine. But we're moving rocks here so...
  It seems he failed in that task as well, to the detriment of his life. It was truly hard to watch- between you and me, you get it right?
  We can't catch a break, and if we do, a hand is waiting to snatch it from under us.
  How did you catch a break?#PSEUDO MU
  Well the Pt.. I mean hypothetically, if we did find Pt prime, no doubt the mining administration would take their cut, the government, even Alfus...
  At the end we wouldn't see much. Greed and irony are quite frightful.
<<endif>>
